WEBVTT

00:31:58.621 --> 00:32:03.288
then you are creating an environment where
people are inclined to hide it

00:32:03.288 --> 00:32:04.454
or misrepresent it.

00:32:04.704 --> 00:32:07.704
Yeah, I mean, if if you punish
people for failing,

00:32:07.704 --> 00:32:11.163
they will do everything in their power
to try to convince themselves

00:32:11.163 --> 00:32:13.204
and others that their project
is not a failure.

00:32:13.954 --> 00:32:19.163
And then they'll identify with the project
and attach their ego to it in

00:32:19.163 --> 00:32:21.621
a way that's very stressful for everyone.

00:32:21.621 --> 00:32:25.329
And then it's no longer as
possible to separate.

00:32:25.496 --> 00:32:30.079
I'm a failure from this idea that I
was pursuing isn't going to work,